#: ../../configuration.rst:9
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration"

#: ../../configuration.rst:11
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The connector reads its configuration from two places. The settings file "
":file:`/etc/asm-connections.json` holds the Apple School Manager "
"accounts, the schools that the connector synchronizes to each of them, "
"and every setting that controls which users the connector exports and how"
" it maps their attributes. The app settings in the :term:`App Center` "
"hold the synchronization schedule and a few switches for everyday "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Der Connector liest seine Konfiguration aus zwei Quellen. Die App-"
"Einstellungen im :term:`App Center` enthalten die Einstellungen, die Sie "
"für den täglichen Betrieb benötigen, etwa die Zugangsdaten und den "
"Zeitplan der Synchronisation. Die :term:`UCR` enthält die Einstellungen, "
"die steuern, welche Benutzer der Connector exportiert und wie er ihre "
"Attribute abbildet."

#: ../../configuration.rst:22
msgid ""
"Apple School Manager uses the email address of a user as the Apple Account. "
"Make sure that every synchronized user has a primary email address. Apple "
"School Manager can't create an account for a user without one. See "
":ref:`configuration-email`."
msgstr ""
"Apple School Manager verwendet die E-Mail-Adresse eines Benutzers als Apple "
"Account. Stellen Sie sicher, dass jeder synchronisierte Benutzer eine "
"primäre E-Mail-Adresse hat. Für Benutzer ohne primäre E-Mail-Adresse kann "
"Apple School Manager kein Konto anlegen. Siehe :ref:`configuration-email`."

